Output "assets/images/pi-model-pick-dark.gif"

Source "scripts/demo/style-dark.tape"
Set Height 760

Hide
Type "cd $DEMO_HOME/stats && clear && exec $PI_PREFIX env HOME=$DEMO_HOME pi $PI_FLAGS 2>/dev/null"
Enter
Sleep 4s
Show

Sleep 1s
Type "/pick"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Down
Sleep 600ms
Down
Sleep 600ms
Down
Sleep 1s
Type "opus"
Sleep 1.5s
Down
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 3s
